{"title":"WordPress Plugin : Delete All Post","link":"https://iannnnn.com/2026/3426","date":1779021296000,"content":"<p>Just made a very simple WordPress Plugin : <strong><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1-U79Nb1dgGhf0-4lky6_XQ12_izRa_TH/view?usp=sharing\">Delete All Post</a></strong></p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"355\" src=\"/media/46e86baf9d60e153d49bdcb095011cb77f3d577eab252ede3926bd6d765722da.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/media/46e86baf9d60e153d49bdcb095011cb77f3d577eab252ede3926bd6d765722da.png 1024w, /media/2c59822b34673ffd1d59527324a02523f10e9916fe2c361fb8fcb8744dd698e4.png 300w, /media/3eadb037c0ca84906b272a736badf82c7005f4401f6549f2d34476c62e8b07a6.png 768w, /media/573bfdeea34c8e199eb0f4553385fba6aa41caf1bdb248513164499d32b05c6d.png 1066w\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>From my very short and simple prompt in Gemini.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"317\" src=\"/media/7277760f45f26ea54e9c29e2646890694b6b13f25a8148a9e2edef4d4442fefd.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/media/7277760f45f26ea54e9c29e2646890694b6b13f25a8148a9e2edef4d4442fefd.png 1024w, /media/784176a3a53b4af340d495a90787f8a2ba40e937958d26f8b88aec1c85a0d8d3.png 300w, /media/ebb1029e2e6e858ce8a64e4b754f5e83525c1d30a6baf47ba307e9232fb3e450.png 768w, /media/1dac34d3b64b397d0c05c50bbb5da9a09d8940aa10ba182aa3d1f27b5d89337a.png 1390w\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Warning:</strong> When you press “delete all posts”.<br />It will clear your website posts permanently. Cannot undo.</p>\n\n\n\n<figure><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"620\" height=\"226\" src=\"/media/d2ea21e561924784feaf04abbf6ac071cd70c853a3e61260e33eed7788d13520.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"/media/d2ea21e561924784feaf04abbf6ac071cd70c853a3e61260e33eed7788d13520.png 620w, /media/cdd9d5451dc13dc28bdf93120954b77d4559eb8dd849ef7135b3d580301bece3.png 300w\" /></figure>\n\n\n\n<p>That’s it.</p>","author":"iannnnn","siteTitle":"iannnnn.com","siteHash":"a633e1d87162133e28114b6caf1c887bfa26aadefce69cc40a9feea913e71870","entryHash":"ea561a1fd99b02ef1d744f2a79a0bec708fe9c9299c1032d98ef3df1a1a4cc93","category":"Thai"}